71"></path><path d=3D"M14 11a5 5 0 00-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 007.07 7.07l1.71-=
1.71"></path></svg></a></h2>
<h3 id=3D"macos">macOS<a href=3D"https://sageaxe.com/blog/wireshark-wifi-pa=
cket-capture#macos" class=3D"heading-anchor" aria-label=3D"Copy link to thi=
