<p>The advantage of Method 2 is that the original <code>wlan0</code> interf=
ace can remain connected to a network while <code>mon0</code> captures. How=
ever, the two interfaces share the same radio, so <code>mon0</code> will on=
ly receive frames on the channel that <code>wlan0</code> is operating on un=
less you explicitly set a different channel [iw documentation, monitor mode=
 section].</p>
<p><strong>Channel Hopping</strong>: For site surveys or broad reconnaissan=
ce, <code>airodump-ng</code> (part of the Aircrack-ng suite) provides autom=
atic channel hopping and can write capture files in pcap format:</p>
