<h3 id=3D"scenario-1-client-cannot-connect">Scenario 1: Client Cannot Conne=
ct<a href=3D"https://sageaxe.com/blog/wireshark-wifi-packet-capture#scenari=
o-1-client-cannot-connect" class=3D"heading-anchor" aria-label=3D"Copy link=
