 00-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 007.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg></a></h3>
<ol>
<li>Start capture on the channel of the target AP</li>
<li>Filter: <code>wlan.sa =3D=3D &lt;client_mac&gt; || wlan.da =3D=3D &lt;c=
lient_mac&gt;</code></li>
<li>Look for the association sequence: Probe &gt; Auth &gt; Assoc &gt; EAPO=
L</li>
<li>Identify where the sequence stops or fails</li>
<li>Check status codes in auth/assoc responses</li>
<li>If EAP exchange fails, check EAP type negotiation and certificate valid=
ation</li>
</ol>
<h3 id=3D"scenario-2-client-connects-but-has-slow-throughput">Scenario 2: C=
lient Connects but Has Slow Throughput<a href=3D"https://sageaxe.com/blog/w=
