 5 0 007.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg></a></h3>
<ol>
<li>Start capture on the client=E2=80=99s operating channel</li>
<li>Filter: <code>wlan.sa =3D=3D &lt;client_mac&gt; &amp;&amp; wlan.fc.type=
 =3D=3D 2</code></li>
<li>Check the data rate column =E2=80=94 are frames being sent at high MCS =
values?</li>
<li>Check the retry column =E2=80=94 what percentage of frames are retransm=
issions?</li>
<li>Check the signal strength =E2=80=94 is the client within acceptable ran=
ge?</li>
<li>Look for CTS-to-self or RTS/CTS frames indicating protection mechanisms=
 are active</li>
</ol>
