vg></a></h3>
<ol>
<li>Capture continuously on the client=E2=80=99s channel</li>
<li>Filter: <code>wlan.fc.type_subtype =3D=3D 0x0c || wlan.fc.type_subtype =
=3D=3D 0x0a</code></li>
<li>Examine deauthentication and disassociation reason codes</li>
<li>Reason 1: Unspecified. Reason 4: Disassociated due to inactivity. Reaso=
n 6/7: Class 2/3 frame from non-associated station (often indicates the AP =
dropped the client=E2=80=99s association state)</li>
<li>Check for 802.11v BSS Transition Management frames that may indicate th=
e AP is steering the client</li>
</ol>
